WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A timer can tell you twelve minutes passed.
It cannot tell you that an hour of meditation happened.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Zen12 sells a short-session audio format.
That part is described plainly by its maker.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A claim about automatic brain changes is something different:
it needs product-specific evidence.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Try the free routine first.
Write down what you want and what actually happens.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Then ask which files, price, support and refunds
the exact checkout really includes.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Keep your choice your own.
We will not link a seller until the commercial terms are verified.
